# Ignores development broadcast logs. A pattern containing a slash is anchored to this
# file's directory, and the Foundry project lives in contracts/, so these need the leading
# **/ to match at all. Real broadcast records are kept as deployment provenance; local
# anvil runs and dry-run simulations are not.
**/broadcast/*/31337/
**/broadcast/**/dry-run/

